WEBVTT

00:00.370 --> 00:05.335
<i>[energetic music]</i>
<i>[充满活力的音乐]</i>

00:05.404 --> 00:12.301
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:12.370 --> 00:13.266
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

00:13.335 --> 00:14.749
Oh... hey!
哦……嘿！

00:14.818 --> 00:16.335
<i>- See them flip...
- Aah!</i>
<i>- 看到它们翻转...
- 啊啊！</i>

00:16.404 --> 00:17.404
Ha ha ha ha ha!
哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！

00:17.473 --> 00:19.094
<i>See them soar...</i>
<i>看着他们翱翔......</i>

00:19.163 --> 00:21.784
<i>see them juggle
and so much more.</i>
<i>看他们杂耍
还有更多。</i>

00:21.853 --> 00:24.266
<i>It's Circus Sea Fleas!</i>
<i>这是马戏团海跳蚤！</i>

00:24.335 --> 00:26.508
[honk honk honk]
[喇叭喇叭喇叭]

00:26.577 --> 00:28.991
<i>And they were born
to please you.</i>
<i>他们出生了
来取悦你。</i>

00:29.059 --> 00:31.301
- Ha ha ha ha ha!
- Ha ha ha ha ha!
- 哈哈哈哈哈哈！
- 哈哈哈哈哈哈！

00:31.370 --> 00:35.370
Yay! We love you,
Circus Sea Fleas.
耶！我们爱你，
马戏团海跳蚤。

00:35.439 --> 00:37.611
<i>And the fleas love you.</i>
<i>跳蚤爱你。</i>

00:37.680 --> 00:42.473
<i>Remember, Circus Sea Fleas
live to perform just for you!</i>
<i>记住，马戏团海跳蚤
只为你而活！</i>

00:42.542 --> 00:45.301
We've been
emotionally validated.
我们曾经
情感上得到验证。

00:45.370 --> 00:49.094
<i>Send for your very own
Circus Sea Fleas today!</i>
<i>发送给您自己的
今天马戏团海跳蚤！</i>

00:49.163 --> 00:50.508
Oh...
哦...

00:50.577 --> 00:54.439
I sent for mine yesterday,
and I'm still waiting.
我昨天寄了我的，
我还在等待。

00:54.508 --> 00:56.577
<i>- Bummer, dude!
- What?</i>
<i>- 真糟糕，伙计！
- 什么？</i>

00:56.646 --> 00:58.749
<i>Bummer Dude action figures.</i>
<i>Bummer Dude 可动玩偶。</i>

00:58.818 --> 01:00.059
<i>They're miserable.
[all moaning]</i>
<i>他们很痛苦。
[全都呻吟]</i>

01:00.128 --> 01:01.128
Oh...
哦...

01:01.991 --> 01:03.680
Hey, hey, hey SpongeBob.
嘿嘿嘿海绵宝宝

01:03.749 --> 01:07.266
Got a buncha great stuff
for you today.
得到了一些很棒的东西
今天给你。

01:07.335 --> 01:09.991
The new "Spatula Emporium"
catalog.
新的“抹刀商场”
目录。

01:10.059 --> 01:11.473
No.
不。

01:11.542 --> 01:14.853
Free money from
the sweepstakes you won.
免费资金来自
您赢得的抽奖。

01:16.025 --> 01:17.232
No.
不。

01:17.301 --> 01:19.508
A letter from your family.
一封来自你家人的信。

01:22.991 --> 01:25.473
No.
Packages, how about packages?
不。
套餐，套餐怎么样？

01:25.542 --> 01:27.197
You have any packages for me?
你有什么包裹要给我吗？

01:27.266 --> 01:28.887
No packages.
没有包裹。

01:28.956 --> 01:31.542
Sorry to disappoint you, SpongeBob.
抱歉让你失望了，海绵宝宝。

01:31.611 --> 01:34.059
What makes you think
I'm disappointed?
是什么让你觉得
我很失望？

01:36.749 --> 01:39.439
Everything's just fine.
一切都很好。

01:39.508 --> 01:41.956
<i>Man, what a sad sponge.</i>
<i>伙计，真是一块悲伤的海绵。</i>

01:42.025 --> 01:45.094
<i>That's right,
introducing Sad Sponge,</i>
<i>没错，
介绍悲伤海绵，</i>

01:45.163 --> 01:47.542
<i>The newest Bummer Dude
action figure.</i>
<i>最新的无赖家伙
可动人偶。</i>

01:47.611 --> 01:49.301
Oh...
哦...

01:50.059 --> 01:53.025
<i>And kick, and twist, and kick.</i>
<i>然后踢，扭，踢。</i>

01:53.094 --> 01:56.094
<i>Higher ladies.
I said higher.</i>
<i>高等女士。
我说更高。</i>

02:01.301 --> 02:03.404
I'll show you high.
我会向你展示高。

02:03.473 --> 02:05.232
[groaning]
[呻吟]

02:05.301 --> 02:06.956
Huh?
啊？

02:09.715 --> 02:11.473
[sizzling]
Aah!
[嘶嘶声]
啊啊！

02:11.542 --> 02:13.439
<i>Feel the burn.</i>
<i>感受燃烧的感觉。</i>

02:13.508 --> 02:15.956
I feel it!
我感觉到了！

02:16.025 --> 02:18.370
Ahh...
啊...

02:18.439 --> 02:19.749
[doorbell rings]
Huh?
[门铃响]
啊？

02:24.301 --> 02:27.784
Oh. Pink leg warmers?
哦。粉色暖腿套？

02:27.853 --> 02:31.508
- Yeah, so?
- So...
- 是啊，所以？
- 所以...

02:31.577 --> 02:33.646
I love 'em!
我爱他们！

02:33.715 --> 02:36.542
We're leg warmer buddies.
- Oh, please.
我们是暖腿伙伴。
- 哦，拜托。

02:36.611 --> 02:41.404
I wouldn't be caught dead
in leg warmers with that hat.
我不会被抓死
戴着那顶帽子的暖腿套。

02:41.473 --> 02:43.715
Go back to fashion school.
回到时装学校。

02:45.370 --> 02:48.301
[sighs]
He's right.
[叹气]
他是对的。

02:48.991 --> 02:52.611
Hello, fashion school?
I'm coming back!
你好，时装学校吗？
我回来了！

02:52.680 --> 02:55.439
I'm reborn!
我重生了！

02:56.232 --> 02:58.646
What?
This package isn't even for me.
什么？
这个包裹甚至不适合我。

02:58.715 --> 03:00.301
It's for SpongeBob.
这是给海绵宝宝的。

03:00.370 --> 03:01.853
Hmph.
哼。

03:05.439 --> 03:07.680
That mailman is a moron.
那个邮递员是个白痴。

03:09.232 --> 03:12.956
[overlapping yelling, whooping]
[重叠的喊叫、呼喊]

03:13.025 --> 03:16.680
[fleas muttering, whooping]
[跳蚤低语，呼喊]

03:18.025 --> 03:20.197
And time for me to eat.
还有我吃饭的时间。

03:22.508 --> 03:23.611
[fleas yelling, chattering]
[跳蚤大喊大叫，叽叽喳喳]

03:23.680 --> 03:25.680
And...
和...

03:25.749 --> 03:28.853
Bowl is nice and clean.
[humming]
碗又漂亮又干净。
[嗡嗡声]

03:28.922 --> 03:32.094
Grab my favorite spoon.
[humming]
拿起我最喜欢的勺子。
[嗡嗡声]

03:32.715 --> 03:35.646
Brush on my shirt.
[humming]
刷在我的衬衫上。
[嗡嗡声]

03:38.577 --> 03:41.404
Milk is smelling fresh.
[humming]
牛奶闻起来很新鲜。
[嗡嗡声]

03:41.473 --> 03:44.956
[fleas clamoring, chattering]
[跳蚤吵闹，喋喋不休]

03:45.991 --> 03:49.646
Cereal gives me pep.
[humming]
麦片让我充满活力。
[嗡嗡声]

03:49.715 --> 03:52.025
[fleas yelling, whooping]
[跳蚤大喊大叫]

03:52.094 --> 03:55.508
It's moving by itself.
[humming]
它自己在移动。
[嗡嗡声]

03:55.577 --> 03:58.749
Ghosts are in my bowl.
[humming]
鬼魂在我的碗里。
[嗡嗡声]

03:58.818 --> 04:01.715
Ghosts are in my bowl?
我碗里有鬼？

04:01.784 --> 04:04.163
Ghosts are in my bowl!
我碗里有鬼！

04:06.646 --> 04:10.508
<i>[eerie music]</i>
<i>[怪异音乐]</i>

04:10.577 --> 04:14.680
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

04:14.749 --> 04:16.784
Huh?
啊？

04:23.680 --> 04:25.266
[gasps]
[喘气]

04:25.335 --> 04:27.404
Aah!
啊啊！

04:27.473 --> 04:29.991
My kitchen's haunted!
我的厨房闹鬼了！

04:35.818 --> 04:37.163
Calm down, Squidward.
冷静点，章鱼哥。

04:37.232 --> 04:41.542
You're just seeing things
because you're so tired.
你只是看到了一些东西
因为你太累了。

04:41.611 --> 04:45.784
Yeah, yeah, that's it.
You just need some more sleep.
是啊是啊，就是这样。
你只是需要多睡一会儿。

04:45.853 --> 04:51.404
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

04:51.473 --> 04:53.370
[snoring softly]
[轻柔的鼾声]

04:53.439 --> 04:56.370
[fleas clamoring, whooping]
[跳蚤的叫喊声、呼喊声]

05:05.818 --> 05:08.611
<i>[fanfare, crowd cheering]</i>
<i>[大张旗鼓，人群欢呼]</i>

05:08.680 --> 05:10.163
Huh?
啊？

05:10.232 --> 05:12.473
What? Oh...
什么？哦...

05:12.542 --> 05:14.059
I must still be dreaming.
我一定还在做梦。

05:14.991 --> 05:18.404
<i>[lively circus music]</i>
<i>[热闹的马戏音乐]</i>

05:18.473 --> 05:20.887
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

05:20.956 --> 05:22.646
Blblblblb.
Huh?
blblbllb。
啊？

05:22.715 --> 05:24.611
Hup... hup...
呼……呼……

05:24.680 --> 05:26.646
hup... huh!
呼……呼！

05:26.715 --> 05:28.680
Huh-huh-huh-huh...
哈哈哈哈哈哈哈...

05:28.749 --> 05:34.128
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:34.197 --> 05:38.611
Welcome to your Sea Flea Circus.
欢迎来到您的海跳蚤马戏团。

05:38.680 --> 05:43.473
It's our duty to entertain you.
招待您是我们的责任。

05:49.577 --> 05:51.232
How delightful.
多么令人愉快啊。

05:52.301 --> 05:53.922
Huh?
啊？

06:00.197 --> 06:02.232
Amazing.
惊人的。

06:02.301 --> 06:04.301
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:04.370 --> 06:06.473
Huh? What's next?
啊？接下来怎么办？

06:08.163 --> 06:09.749
[twirr]
[旋转]

06:09.818 --> 06:12.611
Lunchtime.
午餐时间。

06:12.680 --> 06:14.025
Lunchtime?
午餐时间？

06:14.094 --> 06:16.473
Why would a dream need a...
为什么梦想需要...

06:16.542 --> 06:18.370
Aah!
啊啊！

06:23.818 --> 06:26.749
Aah!
This isn't a dream!
啊啊！
这不是梦！

06:26.818 --> 06:29.335
It's an infestation!
这是一种感染！

06:52.266 --> 06:54.991
Huh?
Where'd they go?
啊？
他们去哪儿了？

06:55.887 --> 06:59.059
Oh! Hmm...
Not bad.
哦！嗯...
不错。

07:02.646 --> 07:05.232
Aah! Aah!
啊啊！啊啊！

07:06.335 --> 07:11.577
I look amazing. Please don't
ruin this by biting my face.
我看起来棒极了。请不要
咬我的脸毁了这一切。

07:13.611 --> 07:16.404
Aah! You ruined it.
啊啊！你毁了它。

07:22.749 --> 07:25.266
Ah...
啊...

07:30.335 --> 07:32.922
Why is this happening to me?
为什么这种事会发生在我身上？

07:36.370 --> 07:38.784
Oh, yeah. Karma.
哦，是的。业力。

07:38.853 --> 07:40.542
[gong echoes]
[锣声回响]

07:40.611 --> 07:42.163
Help!
Ooh...
帮助！
哦...

07:45.128 --> 07:47.128
Hey? What are you...
嘿？你是做什么的...

07:47.197 --> 07:50.059
Oh! That feels nice and warm.
哦！那种感觉又美好又温暖。

07:53.473 --> 07:57.335
It's actually getting
kind of hot now.
实际上正在得到
现在有点热。

07:57.404 --> 08:01.370
Hey. You're trying to cook me.
Let me out of here.
嘿。你想把我煮熟了
让我离开这里。

08:04.577 --> 08:07.266
Parsnip?
Puh!
防风草？
噗！

08:08.680 --> 08:10.370
Are you crazy?
你疯了？

08:10.439 --> 08:14.508
You don't serve a prime piece
of meat like me with parsnip.
你没有提供优质作品
像我这样的肉加防风草。

08:14.577 --> 08:18.128
You need lemons
to brighten my flavors
你需要柠檬
来提亮我的口味

08:18.197 --> 08:21.266
and some pepper or spice.
和一些胡椒或香料。

08:28.611 --> 08:31.197
Ah! Much better.
啊!好多了。

08:31.266 --> 08:32.818
Now let me out of here!
现在让我离开这里！

08:32.887 --> 08:34.956
Aah!
啊啊！

08:36.266 --> 08:40.025
[Squidward screaming, yelling]
[章鱼哥尖叫，大喊]

08:43.853 --> 08:45.611
<i>Now you're cookin'.</i>
<i>现在你开始做饭了。</i>

08:48.163 --> 08:51.163
Huh? Oh, no,
my buttons are tarnished.
啊？哦，不，
我的纽扣失去光泽了。

08:51.232 --> 08:52.508
No circus flea is going to want
马戏团的跳蚤不会想要

08:52.577 --> 08:55.232
to perform for a guy
with tarnished buttons.
为一个男人表演
带有失去光泽的按钮。

09:01.197 --> 09:02.577
Fa la la la la la!
啦啦啦啦啦！

09:02.646 --> 09:05.370
[horn toots distantly]
[gasps] Circus music?
[远处传来喇叭声]
[喘气]马戏音乐？

09:05.439 --> 09:08.301
Hmm.
[horns tooting]
唔。
[喇叭声]

09:15.508 --> 09:18.646
Oh, hey, Squidward.
Just checking.
哦，嘿，章鱼哥。
只是检查。

09:18.715 --> 09:20.915
You've haven't seen a package
addressed to me, have you?
你还没见过包裹
是写给我的吗？

09:24.163 --> 09:27.542
My circus fleas!
Yes!
我的马戏团跳蚤！
是的！

09:27.611 --> 09:30.266
They came! They came!
他们来了！他们来了！

09:30.335 --> 09:33.439
Hey, this box is empty.
Where did the fleas go?
嘿，这个盒子是空的。
跳蚤去哪儿了？

09:36.784 --> 09:38.370
Hello, fleas.
你好，跳蚤。

09:38.439 --> 09:41.404
I hope you fed them, Squidward.
They can get pretty hungry.
我希望你喂饱它们，章鱼哥。
他们可能会很饿。

09:41.473 --> 09:46.128
Oh, I fed them all right.
Please take them away now.
哦，我喂他们没问题。
请现在就把它们带走。

09:46.197 --> 09:47.749
You got it.
你明白了。

09:47.818 --> 09:49.991
Ho! Alley-oop, waah!
嗬！空中接力，哇！

09:50.059 --> 09:53.577
[fleas chattering]
[跳蚤喋喋不休]

09:59.508 --> 10:01.301
Ta-da!
哒哒！

10:02.818 --> 10:04.163
Ha ha ha ha ha!
哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！

10:04.232 --> 10:06.956
Now let's take this circus
to my place.
现在让我们看看这个马戏团
到我的地方。

10:09.542 --> 10:11.163
All aboard!
全部上车！

10:11.232 --> 10:13.611
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:13.680 --> 10:16.025
[toot toot]
[嘟嘟]

10:16.094 --> 10:20.266
May all your days
be Sea Flea Circus days.
愿你所有的日子
是海跳蚤马戏团的日子。

10:20.577 --> 10:22.542
Best day ever!
有史以来最好的一天！

10:27.301 --> 10:29.370
Stupid circus fleas.
愚蠢的马戏团跳蚤。

10:29.439 --> 10:31.680
Just look at the mess they left.
只要看看他们留下的烂摊子就知道了。

10:31.749 --> 10:32.853
Hmm?
唔？

10:32.922 --> 10:34.611
What's this?
这是什么？

10:34.680 --> 10:36.128
Oh.
[twirr]
哦。
[旋转]

10:36.197 --> 10:40.818
[commotion, yelling]
[骚乱、叫喊]

10:40.887 --> 10:44.370
<i>Aah!</i>
<i>啊！</i>

<i>啊！</i>